        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/ac8455/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-12-02T10:25:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My first time playing at home I basically broke this card, setting it on one of Omnicron’s electro-pulse bombs.</p>\n<p>Preventing 15 (Diminishing by 2 {Pre errata per hero of course) dmg from 5 heroes, redirecting it around as I wish while leaving the bomb with 7 hp (For a second go round) at the cost of just 10 hp using just one card…</p>\n<p>Yeah, thats pretty darn epic if you ask me. After that Magic: The Gathering just doesn’t thrill me anymore.</p>",
